            "content_html": "<h2 id=\"商品管理网站——基于PHP的动态网站设计与实现\"><a href=\"#商品管理网站——基于PHP的动态网站设计与实现\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"商品管理网站——基于PHP的动态网站设计与实现\"></a>商品管理网站——基于PHP的动态网站设计与实现</h2><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;在网站开发中，数据库的功能是用于存储和处理数据，根据我的商品管理网站需求，设计若干数据表用于存储商品的基本信息。本网站数据表如 <strong>表1.1</strong> 所示。</p>\n<table width=\"1108\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style='width:831.00pt;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;'>\n   <col width=\"127\" style='mso-width-source:userset;mso-width-alt:4064;'/>\n   <col width=\"69\" style='mso-width-source:userset;mso-width-alt:2208;'/>\n   <col width=\"154\" style='mso-width-source:userset;mso-width-alt:4928;'/>\n   <col width=\"200\" style='mso-width-source:userset;mso-width-alt:6400;'/>\n   <col width=\"199\" style='mso-width-source:userset;mso-width-alt:6368;'/>\n   <col width=\"359\" style='mso-width-source:userset;mso-width-alt:11488;'/>\n   <tr height=\"33.33\" style='height:25.00pt;mso-height-source:userset;mso-height-alt:500;'>\n    <td class=\"xl65\" height=\"33.33\" width=\"127\" style='height:25.00pt;width:95.25pt;' x:str>功能</td>\n    <td class=\"xl66\" width=\"69\" style='width:51.75pt;' x:str>表名</td>\n    <td class=\"xl67\" width=\"912\" colspan=\"4\" style='width:684.00pt;border-right:none;border-bottom:1.0pt solid #000000;' x:str>表结构</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr height=\"29.33\" style='height:22.00pt;mso-height-source:userset;mso-height-alt:440;'>\n    <td class=\"xl69\" height=\"218.33\" rowspan=\"8\" style='height:163.75pt;border-right:1.0pt solid #000000;border-bottom:none;' x:str>用户信息表</td>\n    <td class=\"xl70\" rowspan=\"8\" style='border-right:1.0pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:none;' x:str>users</td>\n    <td class=\"xl71\" x:str>字段名称</td>\n    <td class=\"xl72\" x:str>字段类型</td>\n    <td class=\"xl72\" x:str>字段大小</td>\n    <td class=\"xl72\" x:str>注释</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr height=\"27\" style='height:20.25pt;'>\n    <td class=\"xl71\" x:str>id</td>\n    <td class=\"xl72\" x:str>int</td>\n    <td class=\"xl75\" x:num>11</td>\n    <td class=\"xl72\" x:str>用户编号（主键，自增）</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr height=\"27\" style='height:20.25pt;'>\n    <td class=\"xl71\" x:str>username</td>\n    <td class=\"xl72\" x:str>varchar</td>\n    <td class=\"xl75\" x:num>50</td>\n    <td class=\"xl72\" x:str>用户名（唯一）</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr height=\"27\" style='height:20.25pt;'>\n    <td class=\"xl71\" x:str>password</td>\n    <td class=\"xl72\" x:str>varchar</td>\n    <td class=\"xl75\" x:num>50</td>\n    <td class=\"xl76\" x:str>用户密码</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr height=\"27\" style='height:20.25pt;'>\n    <td class=\"xl71\" x:str>usertype</td>\n    <td class=\"xl72\" x:str>varchar</td>\n    <td class=\"xl75\" x:num>50</td>\n    <td class=\"xl76\" x:str>用户类型</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr height=\"27\" style='height:20.25pt;'>\n    <td class=\"xl71\" x:str>usertell</td>\n    <td class=\"xl72\" x:str>bigint</td>\n    <td class=\"xl75\" x:num>11</td>\n    <td class=\"xl76\" x:str>电话号码</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr height=\"27\" style='height:20.25pt;'>\n    <td class=\"xl71\" x:str>usermail</td>\n    <td class=\"xl72\" x:str>varchar</td>\n    <td class=\"xl75\" x:num>50</td>\n    <td class=\"xl76\" x:str>邮箱地址</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr height=\"27\" style='height:20.25pt;'>\n    <td class=\"xl71\" x:str>create_time</td>\n    <td class=\"xl72\" x:str>datetime</td>\n    <td class=\"xl75\"></td>\n    <td class=\"xl76\" x:str>添加时间</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr height=\"27\" style='height:20.25pt;'>\n    <td class=\"xl73\" height=\"27\" style='height:20.25pt;'></td>\n    <td class=\"xl74\"></td>\n    <td class=\"xl77\"></td>\n    <td class=\"xl75\"></td>\n    <td class=\"xl75\"></td>\n    <td class=\"xl75\"></td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr height=\"32\" style='height:24.00pt;mso-height-source:userset;mso-height-alt:480;'>\n    <td class=\"xl69\" height=\"195\" rowspan=\"7\" style='height:146.25pt;border-right:1.0pt solid #000000;border-bottom:none;' x:str>用户信息表</td>\n    <td class=\"xl70\" rowspan=\"7\" style='border-right:1.0pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:none;' x:str>shops</td>\n    <td class=\"xl71\" x:str>字段名称</td>\n    <td class=\"xl72\" x:str>字段类型</td>\n    <td class=\"xl72\" x:str>字段大小</td>\n    <td class=\"xl72\" x:str>注释</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr height=\"27\" style='height:20.25pt;'>\n    <td class=\"xl78\" x:str>id</td>\n    <td class=\"xl76\" x:str>int</td>\n    <td class=\"xl79\" x:num>11</td>\n    <td class=\"xl76\" x:str>商品编号（主键，自增）</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr height=\"27\" style='height:20.25pt;'>\n    <td class=\"xl78\" x:str>shopname</td>\n    <td class=\"xl76\" x:str>vharchar</td>\n    <td class=\"xl79\" x:num>100</td>\n    <td class=\"xl76\" x:str>商品名（唯一）</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr height=\"27\" style='height:20.25pt;'>\n    <td class=\"xl78\" x:str>shopprice</td>\n    <td class=\"xl76\" x:str>int</td>\n    <td class=\"xl79\" x:num>11</td>\n    <td class=\"xl76\" x:str>商品价格</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr height=\"27\" style='height:20.25pt;'>\n    <td class=\"xl78\" x:str>shoptotal</td>\n    <td class=\"xl76\" x:str>int</td>\n    <td class=\"xl79\" x:num>11</td>\n    <td class=\"xl76\" x:str>商品库存</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr height=\"27\" style='height:20.25pt;'>\n    <td class=\"xl78\" x:str>shoptext</td>\n    <td class=\"xl76\" x:str>text</td>\n    <td class=\"xl79\"></td>\n    <td class=\"xl76\" x:str>商品备注</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr height=\"28\" style='height:21.00pt;'>\n    <td class=\"xl80\" x:str>create_time</td>\n    <td class=\"xl81\" x:str>datetime</td>\n    <td class=\"xl82\"></td>\n    <td class=\"xl81\" x:str>添加时间</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr height=\"19\" style='height:14.25pt;'>\n    <td height=\"19\" colspan=\"6\" style='height:14.25pt;mso-ignore:colspan;'></td>\n   </tr>\n   <![if supportMisalignedColumns]>\n    <tr width=\"0\" style='display:none;'>\n     <td width=\"127\" style='width:95;'></td>\n     <td width=\"69\" style='width:52;'></td>\n     <td width=\"154\" style='width:116;'></td>\n     <td width=\"200\" style='width:150;'></td>\n     <td width=\"199\" style='width:149;